{
 "fileKey": "XQHz0qOrTAmZhWw7h71a2S",
 "page": {
  "claude": "0:1"
 },
 "notes": [
  "Color variables in Noddy/Color are named without a 'color/' prefix (e.g. 'glyph/ink' = spec's color/glyph/ink). WEB code syntax is var(--color-<group>-<name>).",
  "Primitives code syntax var(--<family>-<step>), Space var(--space-N), Radius var(--radius-X).",
  "Design system section 50:2 holds an auto-layout frame 'Design system / Layout' (50:3). Glyphs (50:68) and Components (50:78) boards are FIXED-height placeholders (placeholder=true) with an empty wrap auto-layout 'Content' child; set board primaryAxisSizingMode='AUTO' and placeholder=false when filling, then resize the SECTION (sections do not auto-grow): section.resizeWithoutConstraints(layout.width+240, layout.height+240).",
  "Column A (Color, Effects, Logos) is FILL-height and Logos has layoutGrow=1 so both foundation columns end flush (2743px).",
  "Added primitives beyond the spec list: peach/950 #3A2A20 (spec-sanctioned), blue/300 #9CC7EC (glyph/guide light), blue/800 #2D4A63 (glyph/guide dark), green/950 #323D2D, blue/950 #313841, red/950 #4C2421 (dark status tints, 20% mix over warm/950).",
  "Glyphs board 50:68 is now HUG height (2631) with placeholder=false; section 50:2 resized to 2848x8223.33. Glyph components (117 incl. Glyph/ghost) live inside Cell/<name> frames in the board; map is ledger.glyphs (name -> component id). Component = em box adv*0.05 x 123.95, one VECTOR Outline (y pre-flipped in path data, viewBox 0 0 adv 2479, NONZERO), fill bound to glyph/ink, constraints SCALE; baseline at 99.2px. Space/uni00A0 are empty components wrapped in a dashed glyph/guide Advance frame (doc only). Glyph/ghost = 55x123.95 with dashed 2px glyph/ghost rect (cap box, radius/md).",
  "Components board 50:78 is HUG height, placeholder=false; content 50:85 is a VERTICAL stack of groups (Icons, Controls, Glyphs & tools, Editor, Workspace, Agent, States). Each group = Eyebrow + Row of cards (bg/subtle, radius/xl); a card holds a non-auto-layout Variants frame with Mono-small row/col labels + the component set. Cards in a row share a FIXED height; last card FILL. After adding content resize section 50:2 to layout+240.",
  "Added foundations for components: text style Noddy/Icon 16 (status marks) and semantic color bg/accent-hover (peach/400 light, peach/200 dark) used by Button Primary Hover. A paint with opacity<1 bound to a variable rendered as opaque black, so the state-layer approach was dropped.",
  "Shared TEXT properties force one value across variants: AgentMessage uses Message (Agent) + Reply (User); AgentWindow pill uses Idle/Running/Needs you/Paused line props; Composer uses Placeholder/Message.",
  "GlyphTile: only Draft/Kept/Yours variants contain the swappable Glyph instance (property Glyph); Empty/Queued/Drafting/Failed show Glyph/ghost. Showcase tiles kept at 1x because rescaling instances detaches text styles.",
  "FLOW: AgentWindow Expanded variants: Messages frames converted to SLOT named Body (same ids 66:178, 66:224, 66:261, 66:313) bound to SLOT property Body#70:0 so flow screens can fill the window body per screen.",
  "FLOW: GlyphTile Glyph INSTANCE_SWAP (Glyph#62:0) REMOVED: swapping kept the nested instance at a fixed 23.1px width (nested instance size cannot be overridden), squashing every glyph but a. Replaced by SLOT property Glyph#79:0 bound to a 56x49.58 centered frame named Glyph in the 6 real variants (Draft/Kept/Yours x Selected; slot frames 79:2588-79:2593). Fill an instance by clearing the slot and appending Glyph/<name> instance resized to (comp.width*0.4, comp.height*0.4). All 109 existing real tiles (showcase + flow) were refilled this way.",
  "REVIEW FIX PASS (20 Oct): new primitives warm/550 #75625A (text/secondary Light, AA), warm/850 #3A2E29 (border/default Dark), warm/875 #352B27 (bg/subtle Dark); new semantic bg/scrim, bg/track, border/accent. text/secondary scope TEXT_FILL+SHAPE_FILL, bg/surface-raised +STROKE_COLOR, glyph/guide +FRAME_FILL. GlyphTile: Queued hides its mark on tiles (legend keeps the ring), Drafting = solid 2px status/draft border + 270deg arc mark (StatusMark Drafting ellipse 62:16 is now an arc), Selected = 2px outer focus ring via DROP_SHADOW spread 2 bound to focus/ring while keeping the status border. Dead hidden Ghost layers and Chip Dot ellipses deleted. Nodes appended into instance SLOTs get composite IDs (I<inst>;<slot>;<id>), not the id returned at creation.",
  "VERIFIER FIX PASS (20 Oct, final): Glyph/ghost is now COMPONENT_SET 110:2672 (Height=Cap 57:384 [also ascender letters], x-height 110:2668, Descender 110:2670); specimen ghosts a/m/u/r use x-height, g Descender. StatusMark Queued = mini dashed ghost rect (glyph/ghost) instead of the hollow ring, so legends match Queued tiles. GlyphTile Draft/Drafting variants strokesIncludedInLayout=false (content at 8/8,62 like other tiles). SpecimenCard slider: Value+Knob live in auto-layout Fill 110:2642 (gap -6); knob position = paddingRight override = 80 - value*0.3 - 6 (160 -> 26, 232 -> 4.4). Approval card well: glyphs at 0.9 scale (cap ~67px), padding top/bottom space/1, gap space/2. Ring progress: TopBar Progress ellipse 63:160 arcData override = -90deg + 360deg*n/116 (opacity 0 at n=0; setting visible on that instance sublayer throws). Pill ring 66:340 likewise n/62. Instance sublayer x/y cannot be overridden (relative-transform).",
  "OWNER FIX (20 Oct, panel layout): AgentWindow close (x) IconButton deleted from all 4 Expanded variants (66:176, 66:220, 66:259, 66:311); header keeps only minimize (remove). 08 Export modal close and 06 editor Close (Esc) kept. Expanded agent windows (02/03/04/07) = full-height right column 384x820 at x1032,y56 (top = specimen card top, bottom 24px from screen bottom). SpecimenCard instances 240px tall (slot 148): 984 wide (FIXED, x24 to grid right edge 1008) on 02/03/04/07, FILL 1392 on 05/08; slot glyphs scaled by 148/220. 04 Style frame paddingTop space/4, gap space/10, guides cap y25 / x-height y54 / baseline y139 (labels -18). 05 Drafting g mark at 867,83. Shelf now at workspace y264.",
  "VERIFIER-3 FIX (20 Oct): 03 agent 72:1138 swapped to Status=NeedsYou (slot content preserved) for the orange dot. 07 body got sketch.png Attachment (I76:2263;66:261;121:2806) above the brief; 07 summary chip now 22 new \u00b7 1 failed. AgentMessage Approval main 65:195 Actions 65:208 gap space/2, ghost Edit by hand 65:218 padding L/R space/3. 04 shelf header 75:1097 now SPACE_BETWEEN with Legend 121:2814 (Draft 4 = 121:2818, Queued 58 = 121:2824). SpecimenCard main 64:107 resized 1392x240 (slot 148), default glyphs scaled by 1.6*148/220. Not changed: Paused variant pause glyph 66:308 (status TEXT, not a button; flagged for owner), 06 pill position (inset in editor card, owner asked no 06 layout change), 04 specimen glyph spacing, size labels."
 ],
